#~ msgid ""
#~ "Your entity failed to start. Did you forgot to put your code within a "
#~ "method?\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "This problem often arises when the exercise expects you to put all the "
#~ "code within a \n"
#~ "method e.g. run(), but you put some statements (e.g. forward()) outside "
#~ "of any method.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "The easiest solution to sort it out is to copy all your code (Ctrl-A Ctrl-"
#~ "C), use the \n"
#~ "'Exercise/Revert' menu to reset the template, and paste (Ctrl-V) your "
#~ "code within the\n"
#~ "provided method."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "ຕົວລະຄອນຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ເຈົ້າລືມຂຽນລະຫັດໄວ້ໃນເມທອດ (method) ຫຼື ບໍ່?\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "ບັນຫານີ້ມັກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອບົດຝຶກຫັດກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຂຽນລະຫັດທັງໝົດໄວ້ໃນ \n"
#~ "ເມທອດ ເຊັ່ນ run(), ແຕ່ເຈົ້າເອົາຄຳສັ່ງ (ເຊັ່ນ forward()) ໄປໄວ້ຂ້າງນອກເມທອດ.\n"
